{
  "id": "20796_tanchi",
  "headword": "{探知|たんち}",
  "reading": "たんち",
  "romaji": "tanchi",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "detection; sensing; discovering",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "detection; sensing; discovering",
      "explanation": "Finding or identifying something that is hidden, hard to perceive, or otherwise not immediately apparent, often using instruments or careful investigation."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "20796_tanchi_ex1",
      "japanese": "ガス{漏|も}れを{探知|たんち}する。",
      "english": "To detect a gas leak.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20796_tanchi_ex2",
      "japanese": "レーダーで{敵|てき}の{飛行機|ひこうき}を{探知|たんち}した。",
      "english": "We detected the enemy aircraft with radar.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20796_tanchi_ex3",
      "japanese": "{金属|きんぞく}{探知|たんち}{機|き}を{使|つか}って{地中|ちちゅう}の{遺物|いぶつ}を{探|さが}した。",
      "english": "We searched for underground artifacts using a metal detector.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Composed of {探|たん} (search, probe) + {知|ち} (know, detect). Often used with する to function as a verb. Implies using instruments, technology, or careful methods to find something not easily visible.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {探知|たんち}する: to detect\n- {探知|たんち}{機|き}: detector (device)\n- {金属|きんぞく}{探知|たんち}{機|き}: metal detector\n- {地雷|じらい}{探知|たんち}: mine detection\n- ガス{探知|たんち}{器|き}: gas detector\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {検知|けんち}: detection — similar but more technical/scientific, often used for automated detection systems\n- {発見|はっけん}: discovery — broader, includes accidental finding\n- {感知|かんち}: sensing — perceiving through senses or sensors (e.g., smoke sensor)\n- {察知|さっち}: perceiving, sensing — detecting through intuition or indirect signs",
